{"title":"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Another_Grouping)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Another Grouping)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Sum_of_Geometric_Sequence)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Sum of Geometric Sequence)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef484d1d65d6ae16d11bf8f8a0253157fa2f7bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 1 - 2 + 4 - 8 + 16 - 32 + 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"263\" height=\"16\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cbe4c5f28b1f4e4ea2086148227ef90f46007ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 31 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 33 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 41 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"312\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/4/724883c6eb6ee1f5e27e08b2d866aaed6d9cde9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 1 - 2 + 4 - 8 + 16 - 32 + 64 = -1 - 4 - 16 + 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"422\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1ae21e4667cb61078db5f6fb8050d340e9526dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=-5 + 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf7fd5ae3c89dc095c2a1cb08ad96d48b35c994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Another_Grouping.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Another_Grouping)\">Solution 2 (Another Grouping)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Another Grouping)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can group <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> like this:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/02584471ac2b67e90578a7dcc0880c7966c83074.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 1 + (-2 + 4) + (-8 + 16) + (-32 + 64) = 1 + 2 + 8 + 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"484\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a519bdfffd55daba313dcbbcd2bd43374e460a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=3 + 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf7fd5ae3c89dc095c2a1cb08ad96d48b35c994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Sum_of_Geometric_Sequence.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Sum_of_Geometric_Sequence)\">Solution 3 (Sum of Geometric Sequence)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Sum of Geometric Sequence)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> would be the sum of the terms in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_sequence\" title=\"Geometric sequence\">geometric sequence</a> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb9f413d068da131353aae41ef7c1f4caf149d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/5/965e64bdf90b622156d23ec1bb16470c36b305e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea0402efce9f2319988b2f404519983e0e8ff93e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 7$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is the common ratio, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f8473eac20565df46e727e7b9f14fca92a9ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> term of the sequence, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of terms in the sequence.\n</p><p>For a finite geometric sequence, the sum of the terms would be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab087f65322b9936088d05eb2fc4463029a0b03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{a_{1}(r^n - 1)}{r - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"123\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in what we know, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e08f518adf689d3f4fe91c922a2de271944c77ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{1((-2)^7 - 1)}{-2 - 1} = \\frac{-129}{-3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"211\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf7fd5ae3c89dc095c2a1cb08ad96d48b35c994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC\" title=\"2024 CLMC\">2024 CLMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CLMC_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CLMC Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canada_Lynx_Mathematical_Competition\" title=\"Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition\">Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018030000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 129/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1350/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 91/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100